# =============================================================================
# Orbital time game - .gitignore
# A line is a pattern; "#" starts a comment.
# Leading "/"  : the pattern applies at the repository root only.
# Trailing "/" : the pattern matches folders only.
# Leading "!"  : re-include something an earlier pattern excluded.
# =============================================================================

# --- Personal folders: never published ---------------------------------------
/notes/
/past/

# --- Personal day agendas and everything orbital.py writes next to them -------
# (day files contain your real schedule; the program also writes .bak backups,
#  .tmp files while saving, .npz sample caches and optional .png snapshots)
/day_*.txt
*.bak
*.tmp
*.npz
/*.png

# --- Sounds: keep the folder tree, ignore every audio/video file --------------
# Git does not store empty folders, so each subfolder carries an empty
# placeholder file named .gitkeep (see GITHUB_GUIDE.md, step 4).
/sounds/**
!/sounds/**/
!/sounds/**/.gitkeep

# --- Python --------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Editors and operating system ----------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.dropbox
.dropbox.attr
